1
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:25,760
He's asleep

2
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:29,280
That one

3
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:30,320
Don't worry

4
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:32,160
He's probably just exhausted from playing all day

5
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,680
Tell me the truth

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,040
You already know everything

7
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:43,320
Hey, beautiful

8
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:46,600
Can I ask you for a favor?

9
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:49,680
What is it?

10
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,520
Take him away

11
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,920
Whether he agrees or not

12
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:02,960
You know what?

13
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,640
Blue Kexing

14
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,960
was originally an interstellar nomadic civilization

15
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:10,400
Back then, people traveled to different planets

16
00:01:10,639 --> 00:01:11,880
to experience different lives

17
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:15,360
But because of our fragile physiques

18
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:18,040
stories like yours and his

19
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,640
kept happening over and over again

20
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:22,040
Gradually

21
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,480
Blue Kexing people

22
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:25,160
were forbidden to leave their planet

23
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:27,360
They could only connect through magnetic fields

24
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,760
to their so-called 'right' person

25
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,360
Over time

26
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:35,120
the people of Blue Kexing became colder and more indifferent

27
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:38,160
Turning into beings that only cared about efficiency

28
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:40,200
and doing what was 'correct'

29
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:46,520
Thank you, Qi Miao

30
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:48,560
You allowed Hao Ruichi to experience

31
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:50,920
something that could never be found on Blue Kexing

32
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:02,640
I will take him away

33
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:04,480
Whether he agrees or not

34
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:08,000
Every story must come to an end

35
00:02:46,320 --> 00:02:47,160
What about Qi Miao?

36
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:48,760
She's gone

37
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,960
She said she doesn't want to go through another farewell

38
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:57,840
Hao Ruichi

39
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:01,960
Qi Miao was brave

40
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,480
She has already made her final decision

41
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:06,920
Don't let her down

42
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,800
Qi Miao asked me to relay a few words to you

43
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:18,640
She said

44
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,400
With you gone

45
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,760
Three meals a day

46
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,880
And the four seasons of a year

47
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:24,960
She will live her life just as you hoped,

48
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,880
loving life,

49
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,840
taking good care of herself.

50
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,280
From now on,

51
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,880
she will be her own lucky star.

52
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,320
And,

53
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:39,760
when you go back,

54
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,640
she will also meet the right person,

55
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:45,920
and start a new life.

56
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:49,760
Qi Miao,

57
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:52,720
Qi Miao,

58
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,360
I never expected that,

59
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,440
after writing so many melodramatic plots,

60
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:03,720
one would actually happen to me.

61
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,320
Qi Miao,

62
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:09,160
I have something to do today,

63
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:11,680
so I won't be seeing you off.

64
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:19,040
But if you ever come back,

65
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:21,280
I will be there to welcome you,

66
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:22,960
come rain or shine.

67
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:25,040
If you,

68
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,560
I'm here to tell you,

69
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,800
after going back,

70
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:41,240
I will fulfill my duties as a Star Messenger properly.

71
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:43,320
I will listen to you,

72
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:44,960
and live life well.

73
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:49,240
Not for another meeting or reunion,

74
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:58,800
Goodbye,

75
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,400
Hao Ruichi.

76
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,320
Goodbye,

77
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:11,800
Qi Miao.

78
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:58,000
Elite,

79
00:06:58,280 --> 00:06:59,480
you ate the Blueka Fruit,

80
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,440
letting you live decades on Earth.

81
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:02,800
Live well,

82
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:04,080
and forget Blueka Star.

83
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:18,800
Goodbye,

84
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,600
dear brother.

85
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,240
Don't worry,

86
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,400
Miaomiao has us with her.

87
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:27,680
Goodbye.

88
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:32,080
Who would've thought this guy turned out pretty decent.

89
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:35,480
Goodbye, Hao Piaoliang.

90
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:37,480
You should know,

91
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,040
though far away, there's someone who's not handsome,

92
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:41,120
but humorous and charming—Qi Dongdong.

93
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:43,000
You’ve amazed him for over twenty years,

94
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,520
you are his white moonlight.

95
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:47,360
So, it was a confession.

96
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:49,520
It's almost time.

97
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:50,440
Let's go.

98
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:20,040
No need to wait anymore.

99
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,160
She's not coming.

100
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:31,760
Get ready to board.

101
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:58,880
Hao Ruichi.

102
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:00,320
What do you like about me?

103
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:04,400
That's a bit hard to answer.

104
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:06,000
Come on, just say it.

105
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:07,040
What do you like about me?

106
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:13,800
I like the heartbeat I feel every time we kiss.

107
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:22,040
I like the smile you give me when I act silly.

108
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,520
I like how you share with me

109
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,720
everything—both your joys and your sorrows.

110
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:36,680
I like you.

111
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,960
You’re so beautiful,

112
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:40,480
perfect,

113
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,240
and unique.

114
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:46,920
I enjoy every single minute I spend with you,

115
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,720
even when you don’t say a word.

116
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:51,200
I like you,

117
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,680
because you make me feel whole.

118
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:56,360
I like you,

119
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,560
because you are my friend,

120
00:09:59,240 --> 00:09:59,960
my family,

121
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:01,560
and my girlfriend.

122
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:07,400
I love you

123
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,920
because you’re my entire world.

124
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:20,480
Goodbye,

125
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,280
my lucky star.

126
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:24,680
Get in the car, sis.

127
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,160
Sis.

128
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,840
Don’t you have a new drama press conference to attend?

129
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,680
Why aren’t you wearing something formal, like a dress?

130
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:38,280
They care about my work,

131
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:39,320
not my clothes.

132
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:41,080
Sis, let me tell you something.

133
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,520
As a single woman,

134
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:44,040
you should dress up a bit.

135
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,840
Otherwise, you might never find someone to marry.

136
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:47,840
Alright, alright,

137
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:48,840
I get it.

138
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:49,920
Boss Qi,

139
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:52,080
send me the press conference address.

140
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,560
Wait a moment.

141
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:57,920
We’re going somewhere else first.

142
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:10,000
What are you doing?

143
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:13,760
What's wrong?

144
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:14,960
You scared me!

145
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:16,040
Why are you making such a fuss?

146
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,160
Who told you to mess with that?

147
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,720
Didn't I tell you not to touch anything?

148
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,320
Is it that serious?

149
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,960
I was just tidying up the table.

150
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:24,640
I was just worried you might be too busy.

151
00:12:25,520 --> 00:12:27,240
Too busy with what?

152
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:29,400
I've managed battleships with thousands of crew before.

153
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:31,160
How hard could it be to run a small restaurant?

154
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,160
Yes, yes, you're the best.

155
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:34,240
You're amazing.

156
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,440
Eit.

157
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:37,440
Have you decided on a name for the baby yet?

158
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,360
I've thought it through,

159
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,160
Let's call it Ai, it's simple,

160
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:40,800
How about that?

161
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,680
What kind of nonsense is that?

162
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:44,760
Doesn't it sound good?

163
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:48,040
Then let's call it Ai: A Ray of Light.

164
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,720
Ai Yi Te, Ai Yi Te.

165
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,080
I usually tell you to read more books,

166
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:55,600
What on earth are you even coming up with?

167
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:57,880
Not nice to hear either.

168
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:00,680
Got it.

169
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:03,080
Then let's call it 'Ai's Delicious'.

170
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:05,800
It perfectly suits our careers.

171
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,280
The name doesn’t matter.

172
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:10,480
As long as the baby doesn’t end up as silly as you.

173
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:12,000
I’m not silly!

174
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:26,400
Young lady.

175
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,240
Long time no see.

176
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:29,920
Boss.

177
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:31,400
Do you still remember me?

178
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:32,240
Of course.

179
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:34,960
You are our 1,000th customer.

180
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,560
Why isn't your partner here today?

181
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:41,840
He...

182
00:13:42,680 --> 00:13:44,480
He went on a business trip far away.

183
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:47,680
Then get a bowl of snail noodles.

184
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:48,880
No, thanks.

185
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:50,840
I have something to do today.

186
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:53,000
What could be more important than eating?

187
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:54,120
You know,

188
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,240
don’t just rush through life.

189
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,520
Enjoy it.

190
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:57,280
Have a seat.

191
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:58,560
It'll be ready soon.

192
00:14:04,920 --> 00:14:05,480
Boss,

193
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,240
Get me a bowl too.
